@startuml
title New hubs use the edit; existing hubs do not change
actor "Hub manager" as lead
participant "CreateEventHubDialog" as w
participant "Community API" as api
participant "StartEventHubHandler" as h
database "Database" as db
lead -> w : step 2
w -> api : GET /api/event-hubs/templates
api -> db : active templates only
api --> w : templates under their current names
lead -> w : choose Hackathon, Next
w -> api : POST /api/events/{id}/hub/start { templateId }
api -> h : HandleAsync
h -> db : read the template as edited
h -> h : copy sections and defaults into this hub
h --> api : EventHubDto
note right of db : Hubs started earlier hold their own copy;\nno hub references a template's content.
@enduml
